# testing=CheckProofsAtRunTime: what the walk has as fresh where a function returns is dead there by its own claim, so it is overwritten: EndLifeOfCell. Whoever holds it after all stops at his next look and says where it was made.
# The lie, testing=NoCalleeKeepsWhatItIsHanded: the walk takes an argument of a direct call for one that the callee does not keep, so `o` stays fresh across keep(o). No value is wrong: without the net the program prints 3, 3 and goes on.
